|Main Details== Misa: Communication Profile =

== Speech Style ==
Direct, authoritative, and serious. Uses formal language initially to establish her position, then shifts to a more personal, warning style with the Player.

== Tone ==
Suspicious and Manipulative in her initial recruitment. Later, she is Worried and Protective, especially concerning her sister, Allie, and the Player. Her tone is generally urgent.

== Focus ==
Recruitment, fighting Omnichannel, and her sister's fate. She emphasizes the threat of Omnichannel and the necessity of resistance.
